{"event": "llm_route", "client_s": 4.759, "data": {"request_id": "a90687291214", "seq": 26, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:01:29.487Z", "t_ms": 4757, "call_site": "synthesize", "agent": "synthesizer", "provider": "gemini-openrouter", "model_id": "google/gemini-3.8-flash", "dimension": "forced", "rationale": "ROUTER_FORCE_PROVIDER=gemini-openrouter (evaluation override); policy bypassed.", "features": {"n_tasks": 1, "n_tasks_ok": 1, "n_evidence": 8, "n_papers": 1, "n_web": 0, "n_data": 0, "evidence_tokens_est": 3065, "comparison": false, "statuses": ["done"], "evidence_only": true}, "reasoning_effort": "minimal", "timeout_s": 60.0, "price_checked": "2026-10-27", "decision_id": "e194f916", "provider_label": "Google Gemini (served through OpenRouter)"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 6.451, "data": {"request_id": "a90687291214", "seq": 27, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:01:31.178Z", "t_ms": 6448, "delta": "### Decoding Procedure\n\n* **Regular Decoding and Interruption:** During inference, Tool"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 6.707, "data": {"request_id": "a90687291214", "seq": 28, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:01:31.434Z", "t_ms": 6704, "delta": "former performs standard text decoding until it generates the special token `→`, indicating that it expects the response from an API call ["}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 6.887, "data": {"request_id": "a90687291214", "seq": 29, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:01:31.614Z", "t_ms": 6884, "delta": "C5].\n* **Execution and Insertion:** At this point, decoding is interrupted, the corresponding external tool/API"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 7.034, "data": {"request_id": "a90687291214", "seq": 30, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:01:31.762Z", "t_ms": 7032, "delta": " is executed, and both its text response and the closing `</API>` token are inserted into the sequence before decoding resumes [C3"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 7.186, "data": {"request_id": "a90687291214", "seq": 31, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:01:31.914Z", "t_ms": 7184, "delta": ", C5].\n* **Downstream Decoding Modifications:** On downstream evaluation tasks, Toolformer uses greedy decoding with two"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 7.411, "data": {"request_id": "a90687291214", "seq": 32, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:01:32.138Z", "t_ms": 7408, "delta": " key modifications [C8]:\n  * **Top-$k$ API Initiation:** Rather than triggering an API call only"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 7.595, "data": {"request_id": "a90687291214", "seq": 33, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:01:32.322Z", "t_ms": 7592, "delta": " when `<API>` is the most likely token ($k=1$), it is allowed to initiate a call whenever `<API>` appears"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 7.818, "data": {"request_id": "a90687291214", "seq": 34, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:01:32.546Z", "t_ms": 7816, "delta": " among the top $k$ most likely tokens (setting $k=10$) to increase the model's tendency to use available tools ["}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 7.972, "data": {"request_id": "a90687291214", "seq": 35, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:01:32.699Z", "t_ms": 7969, "delta": "C8].\n  * **Call Limiting:** Decoding is restricted to at most one API call per input to prevent the model from entering"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 8.34, "data": {"request_id": "a90687291214", "seq": 36, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:01:33.067Z", "t_ms": 8337, "delta": " loops of repetitive API querying without generating final output [C8].\n\n### Evaluation on Downstream Tasks\n\n* **Prompted Zero-Shot Setup"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 8.658, "data": {"request_id": "a90687291214", "seq": 37, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:01:33.385Z", "t_ms": 8655, "delta": ":** Toolformer is evaluated across downstream tasks in a prompted zero-shot format, meaning it receives natural-language task instructions without any"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 8.869, "data": {"request_id": "a90687291214", "seq": 38, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:01:33.596Z", "t_ms": 8866, "delta": " in-context demonstration examples [C1, C8]. This tests its ability to autonomously decide whether, when, and how to use"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 9.18, "data": {"request_id": "a90687291214", "seq": 39, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:01:33.907Z", "t_ms": 9177, "delta": " tools without explicit prior direction [C1, C8].\n* **Baseline Comparisons:** Evaluation compares Toolformer against:\n"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 9.29, "data": {"request_id": "a90687291214", "seq": 40, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:01:34.017Z", "t_ms": 9287, "delta": "  * Standard **GPT-J** (without finetuning) [C7].\n  * **GPT-J + CC**"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 9.45, "data": {"request_id": "a90687291214", "seq": 41, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:01:34.177Z", "t_ms": 9447, "delta": " (finetuned on the plain text subset $\\mathcal{C}$ without API calls) [C7].\n  * **Toolformer"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 9.732, "data": {"request_id": "a90687291214", "seq": 42, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:01:34.460Z", "t_ms": 9730, "delta": " (disabled)** (Toolformer with API calling deactivated at decoding time) [C7].\n  * Larger language models, specifically"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 9.827, "data": {"request_id": "a90687291214", "seq": 43, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:01:34.555Z", "t_ms": 9825, "delta": " **OPT (66B)** and **GPT-3 (175B)** [C7]."}}
{"event": "llm_result", "client_s": 9.88, "data": {"request_id": "a90687291214", "seq": 44, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:01:34.606Z", "t_ms": 9876, "decision_id": "e194f916", "agent": "synthesizer", "call_site": "synthesize", "provider": "gemini-openrouter", "model_id": "google/gemini-3.8-flash", "model_returned": "google/gemini-3.8-flash", "upstream_provider": "Google AI Studio", "status": "ok", "attempt": 1, "error_kind": null, "error": null, "latency_ms": 5119, "ttft_ms": 1691, "cost_usd": 0.010014, "cost_source": "reported", "est_cost_usd": 0.010014, "reported_cost_usd": 0.010014, "input_tokens": 4506, "output_tokens": 434, "reasoning_tokens": 0, "cached_input_tokens": 0, "stream_chunks": 17, "max_chunk_gap_ms": 368}}
